      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: While good to know, this isn't exactly what's being requested. What they're asking for is more of an implementation of the \"open steamvr while changing avatars to ignore trackers\" workaround. As such a feature would be very handy for users wanting to switch to three point for a period of time (such as climbing maps where it's rather buggy or when switching to an avatar that doesn't support full body due to an incorrectly setup armature).\nThis is more important now than it was in the past thanks to the improved avatar loading time, leaving much less time to open steamvr while switching (and also to avoid bugs that are caused by this method).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
