      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Unfortunately not all full body setups allow you to disable or remove the trackers from steamvr during a session. \n\nThere is no reason that the button for recalibration in the latest beta that replaces the sit/stand option can't just open into another quick menu with more options related to full body. Something to consider in the future or if possible an addition in this beta would be nice.",
