      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Tupper, you seriously need to learn how to take feedback from the community. They're asking you to make your game work, and you replying with some kind of technical hack?\n\nBesides the point, I've seen several people have to exit the game due to broken avatars, as well as myself. Having a reset button is a standard diagnostic feature, that should be present and a turn on/off function would do nicely.",
