      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b905dac4d81f646e0c98f9c|full_name}: The official statement can be summed up as such, in regards to the OP:\n\nThere exists no method in our application to disable or enable full-body tracking at run-time. We expect that when you run VRChat, you start the application with the tracker setup you will use until you restart the application next.\n\nAny behavior that results from disabling trackers at run-time, opening/closing system menus, or other actions is undocumented and unsupported.\n\nIt is expected that users restart the application when their tracker configuration changes. This may change in the future when we continue to iterate on this system, but do not have immediate (within the next 1-2 releases) plans to implement said changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
