      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: It is frustrating to see the official statements just outright ignore that the game does switch at runtime. Meaning there does exist a method to enable or disable full-body tracking at run-time.\n\nIn the current open beta not only does the switching still work, but now it also successfully switches the UI at runtime when it detects full-body tracking from a 3PT session.\n\nIf it's automatically checking then a manual toggle shouldn't be that hard. I would love a more detailed explanation as to why some highly requested features that seem easy to implement are not being prioritised so that we are not waiting months to years for something that from my perspective could be done in less than a day and included in any upcoming beta for testing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
