  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-13T20:30:40.995Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes it's desirable to temporarily disable FBT - perhaps you want to wear an avatar that doesn't support fbt, or maybe you just don't want to bother calibrating for an avatar that only has a humanoid rig for technical reasons. Previously this could be accomplished by opening the steamvr overlay, but now that avatar loading is super fast this is quite difficult.\n\nPlease add a way to temporarily disable FBT. Ideally, this should store the calibration of your last FBT avatar so you can switch back quickly, as the dashboard hack does today.\n\nたまに、一時的フルトラを解除したくなるときがあります。今はアバター読み込み中スチームダッシュボードを開くことでできますが、アバター読み込みが早くなったことでかなり難しくなっています。\n\nなので、一時的にフルトラを解除する機能を正式に実装ください。できれば、今のダッシュボード裏技みたいに、最後にフルトラで使ったアバターのキャリブレーションを保持してほしいです。",
